--->InstaClone
Main Folders:--
1.lib/

Contains the main Dart code for the Flutter application. This is where screens, widgets, and app logic are normally created.

2.android/

Contains Android-specific configuration and native files. These files are used when building and running the Flutter app on Android devices.

3.ios/

Contains iOS-specific configuration and native files. These files are used when building and running the Flutter app on iOS devices.

4.test/

Contains Dart test files for the application. Tests help verify that the app's code and functionality work correctly.
